source:
\begin{ex}
If $s$ and $t$ are closed terms, then $\eq[s][t], !A(s)
\Proves !A(t)$:
\begin{prooftree}
\Axiom$ !A(s) \fCenter !A(s)$
\RightLabel{\LeftR{\Weakening}}
\UnaryInf$\eq[s][t], !A(s)  \fCenter !A(s)$
\RightLabel{$\eq$}
\UnaryInf$\eq[s][t], !A(s)  \fCenter !A(t)$
\end{prooftree}
This may be familiar as the principle of substitutability of
identicals, or Leibniz' Law.

target:
\begin{ex}
که $s$ او $t$ تړلې اصطلاحګانې وي، نو
$\eq[s][t], !A(s) \Proves !A(t)$:
\begin{prooftree}
\Axiom$ !A(s) \fCenter !A(s)$
\RightLabel{\LeftR{\Weakening}}
\UnaryInf$\eq[s][t], !A(s)  \fCenter !A(s)$
\RightLabel{$\eq$}
\UnaryInf$\eq[s][t], !A(s)  \fCenter !A(t)$
\end{prooftree}
دا به د يو شان څيزونو د تعويض د اصل يا د لايبنېڅ د قانون په نامه
اشنا وي۔

