ګوډل شمېره وي، بنسټيز بازګشتي دے۔
\end{prop}

source:
\begin{proof}
A !!{sentence} is !!a{formula} without free occurrences of
!!{variable}s. So $\fn{Sent}(x)$ holds iff
\begin{multline*}
\bforall{i<\len{x}}{\bforall{z<x}{}}\\
(\bexists{j<z}{z=\Gn{\Obj v_j}} \lif \lnot\fn{FreeOcc}(x,z,i)).
\end{multline*}
\end{proof}

target:
\begin{proof}
!!{sentence} داسې !!a{formula} دے چې د !!{variable}s ازادې پېښې
نۀ لري۔ نو $\fn{Sent}(x)$ هله صدق کوي چې
\begin{multline*}
\bforall{i<\len{x}}{\bforall{z<x}{}}\\
(\bexists{j<z}{z=\Gn{\Obj v_j}} \lif \lnot\fn{FreeOcc}(x,z,i)).
\end{multline*}
\end{proof}

\begin{prop}\ollabel{prop:subst-primrec}
داسې بنسټيزه بازګشتي تابع $\fn{Subst}(x,y,z)$ شته چې دا خاصيت لري:
\[
\fn{Subst}(\Gn{!A}, \Gn{t}, \Gn{u}) = \Gn{\Subst{!A}{t}{u}}.
\]
\end{prop}

source:
\begin{proof}
We can then define a function $\fn{hSubst}$ by primitive recursion as
follows:
\begin{multline*}
\begin{aligned}
\fn{hSubst}(x, y, z, 0) & = \emptyseq \\
\fn{hSubst}(x, y, z, i+1) & =
\end{aligned}\\
\begin{cases}
\fn{hSubst}(x, y, z, i) \concat y & \text{if $\fn{FreeOcc}(x, z, i)$} \\
\fn{append}(\fn{hSubst}(x, y, z, i), (x)_{i}) & \text{otherwise.}
\end{cases}
\end{multline*}
$\fn{Subst}(x, y, z)$ can now be defined as $\fn{hSubst}(x, y, z, \len{x})$.
\end{proof}

target:
\begin{proof}
بيا تابع $\fn{hSubst}$ په بنسټيز بازګښت داسې تعريفولے شو:
\begin{multline*}
\begin{aligned}
\fn{hSubst}(x, y, z, 0) & = \emptyseq \\
\fn{hSubst}(x, y, z, i+1) & =
\end{aligned}\\
\begin{cases}
\fn{hSubst}(x, y, z, i) \concat y & \text{که $\fn{FreeOcc}(x, z, i)$ وي} \\
\fn{append}(\fn{hSubst}(x, y, z, i), (x)_{i}) & \text{که نۀ وي۔}
\end{cases}
\end{multline*}
اوس $\fn{Subst}(x,y,z)$ د $\fn{hSubst}(x,y,z,\len{x})$ په توګه
تعريفېدے شي۔
\end{proof}

