source:
We can encode truth values in the pure lambda calculus as follows:
\begin{align*}
  \fn{true} & \ident \lambd[x][\lambd[y][x]]\\
  \fn{false} & \ident \lambd[x][\lambd[y][y]]
\end{align*}

target:
