\begin{defn}
The smallest normal modal logic containing $!A_1$, \dots, $!A_n$ is
called a \emph{modal system} and denoted by $\Log{K} !A_1 \dots
!A_n$. The smallest normal modal logic is denoted by~\Log{K}.
\end{defn}

target:
