\begin{lem}[Bounded Recursion]\ollabel{transrecursionfun}
For any term $\tau(x)$ and any ordinal $\alpha$, there is a unique $\alpha$-approximation for $\tau$.
\end{lem}
\begin{proof}
We will show that, for any $\gamma \leq \alpha$, there is a unique
$\gamma$-approximation.

target:
\begin{lem}[محدود بازګښت]\ollabel{transrecursionfun}
د هر ترم $\tau(x)$ او هر ترتيبي عدد $\alpha$ دپاره، يو يوازينے
$\alpha$-تقريب د $\tau$ دپاره شته.
\end{lem}
\begin{proof}
و به ښيو چې د هر $\gamma \leq \alpha$ دپاره يو يوازينے
$\gamma$-تقريب شته.

