Fix $A$; now $A \subseteq \trcl{A}$ by \olref{subsetoftrcl}, which is transitive. So there is some $\alpha$ such that $A \subseteq \trcl{A} \subseteq V_\alpha$ by \olref{lem:TransitiveWellFounded}
