\begin{proof}
For any cardinal $\cardfont{a}$, Cantor's Theorem
(\olref[sfr][siz][car]{thm:cantor}) and
\olref[cardinals][cardsasords]{lem:CardinalsExist} entail that
$\cardfont{a} < \card{\Pow{\cardfont{a}}}$.
\end{proof}

