\begin{defn}
We define a \emph{canonical ordering}, $\canonord$, on pairs of
ordinals, by stipulating that $\tuple{\alpha_1, \alpha_2} \canonord
\tuple{\beta_1, \beta_2}$ iff either:
\begin{enumerate}
	\item $\max(\alpha_1, \alpha_2) < \max(\beta_1, \beta_2)$; or
	\item $\max(\alpha_1, \alpha_2) = \max(\beta_1, \beta_2)$ and
	$\alpha_1 < \beta_1$; or
	\item $\max(\alpha_1, \alpha_2) = \max(\beta_1, \beta_2)$ and
	$\alpha_1 = \beta_1$ and $\alpha_2 < \beta_2$
\end{enumerate}
\end{defn}

target:
\begin{defn}
پر ترتيبي عددونو جوړو يو \emph{معياري ترتيب}، $\canonord$،
داسې تعريفوو چې $\tuple{\alpha_1, \alpha_2} \canonord
\tuple{\beta_1, \beta_2}$ هغه وخت او يوازې هغه وخت وي چې له
لاندې حالتونو يو پېښ شي:
\begin{enumerate}
	\item $\max(\alpha_1, \alpha_2) < \max(\beta_1, \beta_2)$؛ يا
	\item $\max(\alpha_1, \alpha_2) = \max(\beta_1, \beta_2)$ او
	$\alpha_1 < \beta_1$؛ يا
	\item $\max(\alpha_1, \alpha_2) = \max(\beta_1, \beta_2)$ او
	$\alpha_1 = \beta_1$ او $\alpha_2 < \beta_2$
\end{enumerate}
\end{defn}

