\cardfont{a}$. Now define $f^*(\beta, \gamma) = (f(\gamma))(\beta)$
for each $\tuple{\beta, \gamma} \in \cardfont{b} \times \cardfont{c}$.
The map $f \mapsto f^*$ is !!a{bijection}
