There is a $\kappa$ such that $\card{V_\kappa} = \kappa$.
\end{cor}

target:
\begin{cor}
داسې $\kappa$ شته چې $\card{V_\kappa} = \kappa$۔
\end{cor}

source:
\begin{proof}
Let $\kappa$ be a $\beth$-fixed point, as given by \olref{bethfixed}.
Clearly $\omega \ordtimes \omega < \kappa$. So $\card{V_\kappa} =
\beth_\kappa= \kappa$ by \olref{stagesize}.
\end{proof}

target:
\begin{proof}
هغه $\kappa$ واخلئ چې د \olref{bethfixed} له مخې
د $\beth$ ثابت ټکی دے۔ څرګنده ده چې $\omega \ordtimes
\omega < \kappa$۔ نو د \olref{stagesize} له مخې
$\card{V_\kappa} = \beth_\kappa= \kappa$۔
\end{proof}

